481
00:41:00,200 --> 00:41:03,400
Know what? l'll meet you
on the plane on Sunday. Trace this.

482
00:41:03,500 --> 00:41:04,900
Anna?

483
00:41:05,800 --> 00:41:08,200
Get her brought in.
